   "text": "Marist College (Postgraduate) - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nMarist College (Postgraduate)\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nMarist demonstrates excellence in education through an emphasis on quality teaching in a small classroom setting. Our dedicated faculty really get to know their students, leading to mentorship, joint research opportunities, and intellectual guidance. We believe in the value of a liberal arts education and the idea that all students–no matter what their primary field of study–should receive a broad education across many disciplines, learn to think logically and creatively, and be able to communicate effectively. Excellence in education also includes a forward-looking educational philosophy that incorporates the use of technology and meaningful learning opportunities outside the classroom–everything from internships to study abroad to leadership development programs. At Marist, we believe that the best type of education prepares students for success after college.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n26/03/2026 11:42\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n26/03/2026 11:42\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nUnited States\nYearly Fees\nMax: US$43,900.00\nMin: US$33,900.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n25%\n1,357 of 5,475 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPrivate\nProvider\nDirect QS\nFounded Year\n1929\nCampus(es)\nNew York\nCountry\nUnited States\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n01/11/2024\nContract End Date\n01/01/2036\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nhttps://www.marist.edu/student-life/campus-services\nScholarship Offered\nhttps://www.marist.edu/scholarships-fellowships\nYouTube Video Lin